{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>Lo</strong>, a magical owl guarding the last safe village. Transmute enemy souls into screen-clearing spells and fight to protect the only place that feels like home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CRAFT YOUR CHAOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rip power out of corrupted creatures and turn it into <strong>your kind of magic</strong>. Turn the battlefield into a pinball machine by crafting a Chain Lightning that jumps from enemy to enemy, filling the screen with <strong>crackling arcs</strong> as monsters fry in a relentless electric storm. The rules are yours to bend\u2014<strong>mix fire, ice, wind, and poison</strong> to shape a build that matches your unique style.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785640/extras/e58ea1cde27af426a3974f7cfd52dc41.poster.avif?t=1770918437\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785640/extras/e58ea1cde27af426a3974f7cfd52dc41.webm?t=1770918437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785640/extras/e58ea1cde27af426a3974f7cfd52dc41.mp4?t=1770918437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FORGE LIVING WEAPONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn <strong>boss souls</strong> into characterful weapons - living relics that grow as you feed them more souls. Master tight, readable combat, learn enemy patterns, and unleash satisfying finishers as you carve a path through corrupted biomes and towering Guardians. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785640/extras/8795d2cb11829205a6490555d486941d.poster.avif?t=1770918437\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785640/extras/8795d2cb11829205a6490555d486941d.webm?t=1770918437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785640/extras/8795d2cb11829205a6490555d486941d.mp4?t=1770918437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COME HOME TO WARMTH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between runs, restore <strong>Behold Village</strong> and befriend a cozy cast of <strong>animalfolk</strong> who are lovable, quirky, and surprisingly deep. Recover <strong>instruments and musical sheets</strong>, unlock story moments, and jam in town as the soundtrack and your <strong>relationships</strong> blossom. Upgrade Lo, expand shops and amenities, and prepare for your next descent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785640/extras/49633378a570abd998b1939964612354.poster.avif?t=1770918437\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785640/extras/49633378a570abd998b1939964612354.webm?t=1770918437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785640/extras/49633378a570abd998b1939964612354.mp4?t=1770918437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A cozy-tinged action roguelike about souls, songs, and the fight to keep a small village alive.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2785640?t=1770918437","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785640/cf2a7e7fe1e197e3a182682b10de2adbf167735c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770918437","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785640/a20a566a290be9234dae96d61a38d48256951d7f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770918437","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785640/a20a566a290be9234dae96d61a38d48256951d7f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770918437","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>Lo</strong>, a magical owl guarding the last safe village. Transmute enemy souls into screen-clearing spells and fight to protect the only place that feels like home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CRAFT YOUR CHAOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rip power out of corrupted creatures and turn it into <strong>your kind of magic</strong>. Turn the battlefield into a pinball machine by crafting a Chain Lightning that jumps from enemy to enemy, filling the screen with <strong>crackling arcs</strong> as monsters fry in a relentless electric storm. The rules are yours to bend\u2014<strong>mix fire, ice, wind, and poison</strong> to shape a build that matches your unique style.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785640/extras/e58ea1cde27af426a3974f7cfd52dc41.poster.avif?t=1770918437\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785640/extras/e58ea1cde27af426a3974f7cfd52dc41.webm?t=1770918437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785640/extras/e58ea1cde27af426a3974f7cfd52dc41.mp4?t=1770918437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FORGE LIVING WEAPONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn <strong>boss souls</strong> into characterful weapons - living relics that grow as you feed them more souls. Master tight, readable combat, learn enemy patterns, and unleash satisfying finishers as you carve a path through corrupted biomes and towering Guardians. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785640/extras/8795d2cb11829205a6490555d486941d.poster.avif?t=1770918437\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785640/extras/8795d2cb11829205a6490555d486941d.webm?t=1770918437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785640/extras/8795d2cb11829205a6490555d486941d.mp4?t=1770918437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COME HOME TO WARMTH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between runs, restore <strong>Behold Village</strong> and befriend a cozy cast of <strong>animalfolk</strong> who are lovable, quirky, and surprisingly deep. Recover <strong>instruments and musical sheets</strong>, unlock story moments, and jam in town as the soundtrack and your <strong>relationships</strong> blossom. Upgrade Lo, expand shops and amenities, and prepare for your next descent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785640/extras/49633378a570abd998b1939964612354.poster.avif?t=1770918437\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785640/extras/49633378a570abd998b1939964612354.webm?t=1770918437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785640/extras/49633378a570abd998b1939964612354.mp4?t=1770918437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A cozy-tinged action roguelike about souls, songs, and the fight to keep a small village alive.</i></p>","developers":["Soulcraft Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785640/086e497e9c2c9758a1234ecf1772e2ce53a55fcf/header.jpg?t=1770918437","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2785640/1456807071/f64d4ec8f9c51708bbd9f41e0b3115ccf43dbc26/1758929102/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759771088","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2785640/1456807071/f64d4ec8f9c51708bbd9f41e0b3115ccf43dbc26/1758929102/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759771088","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2785640/1456807071/f64d4ec8f9c51708bbd9f41e0b3115ccf43dbc26/1758929102/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759771088","id":257207022,"name":"Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257207022/12f9ffb8ffd0228e2fa94ae77379222f13651623/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759771088"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2785640/1816776879/231340a3b460b1a413132ec3e5ead0145dd00149/1758904103/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759771091","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2785640/1816776879/231340a3b460b1a413132ec3e5ead0145dd00149/1758904103/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759771091","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2785640/1816776879/231340a3b460b1a413132ec3e5ead0145dd00149/1758904103/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759771091","id":257207017,"name":"Cinematic Intro","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257207017