918437"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785640/050d89f33ad586c3b70874de07e086e44e6e4e3a/ss_050d89f33ad586c3b70874de07e086e44e6e4e3a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1770918437","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785640/050d89f33ad586c3b70874de07e086e44e6e4e3a/ss_050d89f33ad586c3b70874de07e086e44e6e4e3a.600x338.jpg?t=1770918437"}],"short_description":"Hunt corrupted beasts and transmute their souls into devastating powers in this cozytinged action roguelike. Master a deep crafting system to design hundreds of unique builds, forge living weapons from boss souls, and return home to restore a village of cute animal folk that\u2019s always waiting for you","steam_appid":2785640,"support_info":{"email":"info@soulcraft.games","url":"https://www.soulcraft.games/"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://www.soulcraft.games/"}